WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:03.060
This feels cool!

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.190
Are we done yet, Shi-chan?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.150
Huh?

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.360
The deal was all the way home, Kana-neechan!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.490
Okay, okay.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.450
Break time.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.530
Since I ended up being the Scum, I'll do whatever the President asks, but still...

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:23.000
We all know you'll lose, so you
shouldn't bet on something so big.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.250
What? It's a given that I'll lose?

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.710
Actually, you're teaming up against me, aren't you?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.500
We're not.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.710
Right, Shi-chan?

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.800
Yeah.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.510
Oh well.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:39.390
Anyway, Shi-chan, you can't wear those to school.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:45.560
I heard some twin sisters wear theirs too, so my teacher didn't say anything about it.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.900
You're such a bad girl, Kana-chan!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.780
Wait! That's not fair, Yuki-nee!

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.280
Look! Look, Kana-chan!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.440
You're the one who suggested it!

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.360
A family of deer!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:55.820
Meow!

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.240
And that's nothing special.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:02.750
Anyway, Kana-neechan, you really are out of shape.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:08.210
Don't underestimate how little energy non-jocks have, Shi-chan.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.250
Stop talking weird!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.970
You're no good at playing dumb like that.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.180
Leave that to Yuki-nee.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.470
Shi-chan, that's mean.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.890
Actually, I just wanted to...

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:24.520
Yuki-neechan, you naturally have that talent, so you're okay.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:27.900
I'm not sure what's okay about that...

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.480
You'll realize your own energy level as a non-jock when you get to junior high.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.870
I don't want to be a junior high student.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.030
Why?

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.620
Junior high is fun too.

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.290
Ready, sis?

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.960
Hey! You brought my digital camera without asking me again!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.210
What's wrong?

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.470
You're not losing anything!

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.300
I'm losing the batteries!

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.640
You can recharge them again!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.260
Hey, Shi-chan! Shi-chan! Print it out later!

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.470
Don't be so picky.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:03.560
Hey, Shi-chan! Shi-chan! Print it out later!

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.390
Okay!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.480
Kana-chan...

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.990
We're terrible.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.160
Yeah, we're terrible older sisters.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.940
Dummy...

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:05.080
Since I woke up early today...

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:10.870
I'll go see Senpai's defenseless, sleeping body!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:17.210
It's a rare occasion that I spend so much time under the same roof as Senpai!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.340
I can't wait for the new dormitory!

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.680
Brrr...

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.510
What a creepy feeling.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.560
Also...

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.070
Um...

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.280
Since it's Christmas,

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:45.120
let's be more jolly...

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.740
Oh yeah!

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.910
I have another present for you besides the tickets, Senpai!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.160
This one is great!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.580
A surprise gift!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.120
It's just for you!

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.460
So, please accept this...

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.930
Senpai wasn't very cheery last night,

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.140
and I don't remember everything that happened.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:11.140
But I'm sure Kanade-senpai will be back to her cheery self with my good morning kiss!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.520
So, here we...

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.360
Oh, sorry.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.820
What's the matter, Kana-chan?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:24.530
Well, actually, maybe it was a close call.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.010
Smooch...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.120
Thank you!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.910
Thank you.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.330
Oh, Shi-chan! You left the crust again!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.210
It doesn't taste good, so Kana-neechan can have it.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.760
Why do you pass everything you don't like to me?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.850
You always give the spare toy to me when you get a duplicate.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.760
This and that just don't seem to be the same thing.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.140
Shi-chan, do you want some tea?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.560
No.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:00.020
Hey, I'll be going grocery shopping later.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.110
Do you want to come with me, Shi-chan?

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.530
It's cold, so no.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.820
Me! Me! I'll come! Me!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.410
Um... Yes, but I wasn't asking you, Saku-chan...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.120
Don't be so bashful, Senpai!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.920
About the future, I think I'll go to Tokyo for high school.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.290
I want to go out with you, Senpai!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.710
Please be more considerate once in a while.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.380
I want to enjoy Hokkaido with you!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.180
I'll go wherever you go!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.010
Fine!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:28.760
Yes! Shopping with Senpai!
Oh, Shi-chan, how about some coffee?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.050
So, Shi-chan...

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:31.430
Yes! Shopping with Senpai!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.770
Bye, Shi-chan.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.900
I'll be in my room.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.450
Shi-chan...

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.710
We'll be back soon.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.170
Yuki-chan,

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:03.130
can I ask you to take care of Shi-chan?

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:07.050
Yes, sure.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.550
Saku-chan, let's go.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.850
Wait up, Kanade-senpai!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.970
Yes! Our first date!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.480
No, no, it's just a shopping trip.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.900
That's what people call a date.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.190
Shi-chan, are you there?

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:25.860
Yeah.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.780
Do you want to have a snack with me?

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:34.530
Are you sure we should eat these?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:40.040
I have another box for Mom and Dad, so it's okay.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.540
Just as I thought.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.170
And Kana-neechan doesn't know about that, does she?

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:44.670
Nope.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.840
You two haven't changed at all.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:55.510
Both Kana-chan and I love you a lot.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.850
I know it's impossible,

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:08.860
but I want the three of us to always be together-you, Kana-neechan, and me.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.910
I hate it when we're not together.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.330
But when Kana-neechan said she'd go to Tokyo,

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:21.040
I knew that you'd go with her for sure.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.710
And I knew that you loved each other too.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:29.800
So when you were doing well up there, I was happy about that...

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:34.970
So I thought I shouldn't get between the two of you.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.180
When I thought about it all, I didn't know what to do anymore.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.140
I know I'm just being selfish,

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.110
and I don't want you to get annoyed at me for that.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:54.120
Right before your birthday, Kana-chan got so much homework at school.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.990
Kana-chan wanted to give you a drawing as a present.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.960
She wanted to show you what we were doing.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.450
She was working on it alongside her homework.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:10.510
But there wasn't enough time to be sure it got finished before your birthday.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:13.680
She was working so late at night though.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:19.010
So she asked me to make something up for her.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.430
So...

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.560
Kana-chan would never forget your birthday.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:30.230
You're just like Kana-chan—always thinking too much about everything.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.740
Yuki-neechan...

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:39.030
Even if we are far away, both Kana-chan and I are always thinking about you.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:42.700
Yuki-neechan, you lied to me?!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.420
Oh, um...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.630
Oh, Shi-chan, Shi-chan! This one's really cool!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.210
It tastes like a banana just like the name says!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.250
I can see that.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:55.220
That's a horrible job of playing dumb—as bad as Kana-neechan.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.640
You'd better be careful.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:02.140
That's mean, Shi-chan.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:12.400
Um, Shizuku-chan, I'm wondering if you'd want to take a bath together...

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.530
I'll take one later by myself.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:14.650
And the way you're talking is weird.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.400
Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.910
I will! Me!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:18.320
Senpai! I'll come!

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.490
It is? Weird?

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:21.740
Me! Me!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.250
You never acknowledge me...
So does Shi-chan really hate me now?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.920
But I got to go on a date with Kanade-senpai, so I'll consider that good.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:33.670
Say...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.630
Yes?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.380
Why are you after Kana-neechan?

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.550
And not after Yuki-neechan?

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:44.180
Between the two of them, isn't
Yuki-neechan kinder and better?

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.310
Why would I have to tell you...

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.440
I could give this to you.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.270
Well...

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:53.860
It was when I went out with people from my club.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.240
Kanade-senpai was there too.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.530
My birthday is in August, so that means it's during summer break.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.580
So I was whining about how I never have friends from school celebrate it with me.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.710
But Kanade-senpai said...

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.380
Well, Kamiyama-san,

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:16.010
look at the situation a little differently.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:20.390
Tell your mom and dad, "Congratulations."

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.140
Yup!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.180
Huh?

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:29.770
The day I was born was also the day my mom and dad became a mother and father for the first time.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:33.570
At first, I thought it was really cheesy.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:37.570
But Mom and Dad really, really appreciated it.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.410
And that made me really happy.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:45.580
So I thought I should have someone who'd say such wonderful things near me.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.750
I have no intention of comparing them as twins.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:55.630
I love Yukino-senpai too, but I love Kanade-senpai the most.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.840
I shouldn't have given up on the bath!

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.510
I see.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:09.480
I sympathize with her, but I really can't help it.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.520
I think Shi-chan knows that too,

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.440
but she still can't help how she feels.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.110
Shi-chan?

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.680
Can I sleep with you tonight?

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.250
Sure.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.250
Come on in.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:36.630
Why are both of you snuggling up to me?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.340
Because you're the warmest!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.630
Isn't she?!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:44.970
See? You should always get in bed first to warm...

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:54.650
No. That's not my fault.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.400
What's wrong, Shi-chan?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.650
Did she hit you somewhere?

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.990
I'm sorry, Onee-chan.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.620
I wish we could...

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.420
stay together...

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.720
Huh?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:31.890
You're our little sister, so don't hold back. Be more selfish.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:35.690
We'll never hate you for that.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:41.480
We can't change our distance from you, but we'll do anything we can for you.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.570
Yeah.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:47.990
I want to hear your voices more.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:51.160
Then we'll call you every week.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.120
Even if I forget, Yuki-chan will remember.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.000
Kana-chan, that's not...

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:59.040
Yes, I promise to call.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.380
Also, that painting you gave me...

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:06.760
I don't want to be alone, so please add you two.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:11.100
Then Shi-chan, start going to school.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.020
And go to high school, then college.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.140
We can get together even after that.

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:17.480
Kana-neechan...

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.860
You are our dear little sister.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.030
Yuki-neechan...

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.900
Yeah.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.820
It's cold and it's so much work, but I'll do my best.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.530
What's this sudden change to this selfish...

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:31.830
Wait, you were serious about hating being cold?!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.330
It's okay, Kana-chan. Don't worry.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.830
Hey, Shi-chan?

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.580
Shi-chan?

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.700
Hello!
